<title>GERMANY: Munich air cargo up 26.8 pct in December 1996.</title>
<headline>Munich air cargo up 26.8 pct in December 1996.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo handled at Munich airport (MUC) rose 26.8 percent to 7,664 tonnes in December, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>The following tables show cargo handled at Munich airport month by month since August 1996.</p>
<p>All figures are in tonnes with percentage changes on the same period 12 months ago.</p>
<p>		    Total traffic    Pct change</p>
<p> August	   5,947		up 15.5</p>
<p> September	6,464		up 13.5</p>
<p> October	  7,137		up 27.7</p>
<p> November	 7,886		up 36.0</p>
<p> December	 7,664		up 26.8</p>
<p>		    Export   Change     Import   Change</p>
<p> August	   2,942    up  5.7    3,005    up 27.1</p>
<p> Septempter     3,223    up ,5.7    3,241    up 22.5</p>
<p> October	  3,622    up 24.4    3,515    up 31.2</p>
<p> November	 4,006    up 30.0    3,880    up 42.8</p>
<p> December	 4,013    up 24.8    3,651    up 29.1</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
